      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Swiss immigrants founded Loving in the 1890s, bringing their culture and traditions to southeastern Eddy County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loving%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Pecos River runs just four miles east of Loving, shaping the region’s ranching history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
